    "path": "Angular/Angular-Detailed-Chunk-06-Forms-Validation/README.md",
    "content": "# Angular Interview Guide — Chunk 6: Forms and Validation\n\nTen separate detailed guides covering questions 51–60.\n\n- [51. How Do You Add Asynchronous Validation?](051-asynchronous-validation.md)\n- [52. How Do You Add Synchronous Validation?](052-synchronous-validation.md)\n- [53. How Do You Handle Dynamic Form Fields?](053-dynamic-form-fields.md)\n- [54. How Do You Map Form Values to Backend DTOs Safely?](054-map-form-values-to-dtos.md)\n- [55. How Do You Prevent Duplicate Form Submission?](055-prevent-duplicate-submission.md)\n- [56. How Do You Reset a Form After Submit?](056-reset-form-after-submit.md)\n- [57. How Do You Show Validation Messages Cleanly?](057-clean-validation-messages.md)\n- [58. What Are FormControl, FormGroup, and FormArray?](058-formcontrol-formgroup-formarray.md)\n- [59. Template-Driven vs Reactive Forms](059-template-driven-vs-reactive-forms.md)\n- [60. When Would You Choose Reactive Forms?](060-when-choose-reactive-forms.md)\n"
