    "path": "Angular/Angular-Detailed-Chunk-10-Senior-Scenarios/README.md",
    "content": "# Angular Interview Guide — Chunk 10: Senior Angular Scenarios\n\n- [91. A Route Guard Works Locally but Fails After Refresh in Production. How Do You Debug It?](091-route-guard-refresh-production.md)\n- [92. An Angular Page Is Slow with a Large Dataset. How Do You Investigate and Fix It?](092-slow-large-dataset-page.md)\n- [93. A Backend API Changes a DTO Used by Angular Screens. How Do You Protect the Frontend?](093-protect-frontend-from-dto-change.md)\n- [94. A Component Has Too Many Inputs and Outputs. How Would You Refactor It?](094-too-many-inputs-outputs-refactor.md)\n- [95. A Junior Developer Put Business Logic in an Angular Component. What Feedback Do You Give?](095-business-logic-in-component-feedback.md)\n- [96. A Memory Leak Appears After Navigating Between Pages. What Do You Check?](096-memory-leak-after-navigation.md)\n- [97. A Role-Based Menu Shows Links the User Cannot Access. How Do You Fix It?](097-role-menu-access-mismatch.md)\n- [98. A Search Box Fires Too Many API Calls. How Do You Solve It with RxJS?](098-search-too-many-api-calls.md)\n- [99. A User Loses Form Data After Navigation. How Do You Preserve It?](099-preserve-form-data-navigation.md)\n- [100. How Would You Structure a Large Enterprise Angular App?](100-enterprise-angular-structure.md)\n"
